<speak>That would suit me. I am comfortable doing the basic things myself, but I do not always notice when a menu has moved. The younger people in the family think that is obvious, because they use these interfaces every day. For me, if the button changes position, I start wondering whether I have entered the wrong section. I would rather have someone show me once slowly than send me a very long guide. A guide with many screenshots looks reassuring, but then I spend more time comparing the pictures than doing the simple thing I wanted to do in the first place.</speak>